        "TileImage": "$($repository ddf117ad-bf1c-4aff-87a4-cb95fce52f3b).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47,\r\rFive targets. Five different solutions.\r\rThree must be eliminated with poison.\rOne requires an SMG.\rAnd one must drown.\r\rDubai has no poison to spare, so bring your own.\rThe SMG must also be brought in.\r\rBut to drown one target, you need a way to make them sick first.\rThere simply isn&apos;t room for everything.\r\rSo, Agent...\r\rHow do you make someone drown without bringing a Sieker?\r\rGood luck.",
